{% import 'landing/sections/_shot.html.twig' as shot %}

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ DEPTH ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="depth">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="depth-inner">
            <div>
                <div class="section-label">The Simulation</div>
                <h2 class="section-title">8-trait personality matrix &amp; dressing room drama</h2>
                <p class="section-sub">
                    Players aren't just numbers. An 8-trait matrix — including Determination,
                    Ambition, Temperament, and Pressure — drives real behaviour. Deal with
                    toxic wonderkids demanding moves, guardian inbox demands, and squad cliques
                    that can ruin dressing room morale.
                </p>
                <br>
                <p class="section-sub">
                    Social graphs track dressing-room relationships and chain into narrative
                    events. Your Manager Traits shift based on the calls you make. Guardians
                    push back. Agents bid. Investors want returns. It's all connected — and it
                    all syncs with Integrity Validation every week.
                </p>
                <figure class="role-visual" style="margin:32px 0 0;">
                    {{ shot.img('manager-archetype', 'Manager profile — Noah Ashworth, archetype THE AUTOCRAT, squad fit 80 for counter football with pace and stamina flagged as needing work') }}
                    <p class="ss-caption">6-Point Ability Matrix</p>
                </figure>
            </div>
            <ul class="depth-list" aria-label="Simulation depth features">
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">01</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>8-Trait Personality Matrix</strong>
                        <span>Determination, professionalism, ambition, loyalty, adaptability, pressure, temperament, consistency — each trait evolves over time and shapes player behaviour.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">02</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Social Graph & Chained Events</strong>
                        <span>Player relationships form dynamically. Arguments, rivalries, and alliances chain into follow-up events that reshape your squad's chemistry week after week.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">03</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Guardian & Agent Dynamics</strong>
                        <span>Young players have guardians with loyalty scores and demand levels. Agents push transfers. Manage relationships or lose your best talent to the highest bidder.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">04</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Dynamic NPC Market</strong>
                        <span>NPC clubs actively manage rosters and bid on players — including yours. Player valuations shift with age, ability, and contract status in real time.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">05</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Player Archetypes</strong>
                        <span>Eight archetypes derived from personality traits. Each has a scout-written report and distinct behavioural tendencies in training and big matches.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">06</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Manager Personality Traits</strong>
                        <span>Three traits define your managerial identity: Temperament (how you react under pressure), Discipline (how you enforce standards), Ambition (how aggressively you pursue growth). Each shifts on a 0–100 scale based on your decisions. The board tracks them. So do your players.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">07</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Full Match Reports</strong>
                        <span>Every match generates a detailed inbox report with individual player ratings, goals, assists, match events, and a team average. Know exactly how you won or lost.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">08</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Trophy Museum & Season History</strong>
                        <span>Every title, promotion, and golden boot is recorded forever in the Museum. Season-by-season stats stored in SQLite — your full career, always intact.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">09</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Club Finances & Investment</strong>
                        <span>Negotiate equity deals with investors, renew or void sponsor contracts, and allocate capital across wages, facilities, and transfers. Every financial decision determines how fast your club can grow — and how exposed you are when things go wrong.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="depth-item">
                    <span class="depth-num">10</span>
                    <div class="depth-text">
                        <strong>Integrity Syncing</strong>
                        <span>Gameplay runs entirely offline on-device. When you sync, the server validates your week progression — week rollbacks are permanently rejected. Every advance you make is logged in an immutable SyncRecord. Cheat-proof. Tamper-evident. Your leaderboard position is earned.</span>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
